                "locator": "you’ll be able to tailor your Demand Gen campaigns to serve specifically on YouTube Shorts",
                "source_site": "Google Ads Help",
                "source_title": "Demand Gen channel controls",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "It is part of Demand Gen channel controls, which cover Google's visual-first surfaces including YouTube, Gmail, Discover, Maps and the Google Display Network.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "google.demand_gen.channels",
                "source_url": "https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/15973205?hl=en",
                "locator": "What are channel controls?",
                "source_site": "Google Ads Help",
                "source_title": "Demand Gen channel controls",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Advertisers use manual channel selection ('Let me choose') in ad group settings to restrict serving to chosen channels, with YouTube Shorts listed as one of the YouTube sub-options alongside in-stream and in-feed.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "google.demand_gen.channels",
                "source_url": "https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/15973205?hl=en",
                "locator": "Manual channel selection - Let me choose",
                "source_site": "Google Ads Help",
                "source_title": "Demand Gen channel controls",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Selecting a single channel such as Shorts narrows inventory, so Google encourages using the full Demand Gen inventory to maximize reach; the estimated campaign results panel shows whether the selected channel and audience will reach enough of the intended audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "google.demand_gen.channels",
                "source_url": "https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/15973205?hl=en",
                "locator": "To maximize reach across channels...",
